Related","section_type":"normalPoster"},{"data":[{"items":[],"id":9857,"title":"","description":"0","card_type":"comments","type":"comments","url":"","style":null,"length":0,"continue_watching_progress":0}],"id":0,"title":"Comments","section_type":"comments"}],"post_info":{"genres":["Action","Drama","Family"],"id":9857,"type":"MOVIE","title":"Mirchi","logo":"","image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk46/shows/e9d308c4-c4b7-4d17-be49-903df2004dc0.jpg","background_image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk52/shows/2d7a9d38-b1f6-45e6-92fb-1341dada6847.jpg","likes":24,"dislikes":2,"views":3630,"release_date":"1360195200000","length":9618,"description":"The movie begins with Jai bharath varma (Prabhas) practicing guitar when a girl runs to him and asks him to save her from a gang of goons chasing her. Then Jay, without fighting, resolves the conflict. The girl introduces herself as Manasa (Richa Gangopadhyay). They slowly become friends. But one day she asks Jai to leave her and go as she cannot stand the separation from him if their relationship develops any further. He then goes back to India and changes the mind of Manasa's brother and when they give a vacation he goes with him to his village. There, where everyone are conservative in nature, he changes their nature and makes them more lovable.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":7.1}],"value":7.1,"age":"PG-13"},"episode_id":9857,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}